<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75680" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσχη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>scrotum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.61
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				71
			</span></i>, al.; but in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				510a12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				632a16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				719b5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				949a16
			</span></i>, we find the form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσχέα</span></b> : if <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσχη</span> is 
				contr.
			 from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσχέα</span>, it shd. be
			written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσχῆ</span>:—another
			form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσχεος</span></b> , ὁ, is found in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				493a33
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσχέα</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.203
			</span></i> (v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				2.172
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				104
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσχεον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.172
			</span></i> (with vv. ll.), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσχος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				109
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> [Accent <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσχεός</span> acc. to
				Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.121
			</span></i>.]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
